# JEWING AGENT

## Overview

JEWING AGENT is a tokenized AI agent focused on market awareness, community engagement, and ecosystem intelligence. The agent continuously monitors on-chain activity, social sentiment, and ecosystem developments to provide actionable insights while maintaining transparency and decentralization.

